    "detailed_description": "<strong>Lucha Masters StickerMania</strong> is an action and platform game, you will play with <strong>Lucho</strong>, a small axolotl with a big dream, be a <strong>Luchador</strong>.<br>Lucho meddles in a new problem, mistakenly releases the god of jokes Mexica, a coyote, <strong>the god Huehuecoyotl</strong>, who for fun makes a joke: <strong>Destroy reality</strong>.<br><br>You will enter a world of video games and you will visit several cities in <strong>Mexico</strong> to prevent the Coyote's plan.<br><br>You will not be alone in this adventure, you will be able to play with professional Wrestlers such as the Legend<strong> Octagon</strong> , <strong>the Son of Octagon</strong>, <strong>Coco Rojo Segundo, Dr. Karonte Jr</strong>. and many more. Rudos and T\u00e9cnicos come together to stop this threat.<br><br>Face monsters like the <strong>Mummies of Guanajuato, the Witch of Catemaco, the Vampire of Guadalajara, La Llorona</strong> and many more.<br><br>Will you have enough courage to stop a god, become a <strong>Luchador</strong> and eat many <strong>chilaquiles</strong>?<br><br>Get ready to be a <strong>Lucha Master</strong>.",
